{"id":"932deccafc8aeaa8","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-letterless-normal-form.md","title":"Canonical Letterless Normal Form","display":"df-letterless-normal-form — Canonical Letterless Normal Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-letterless-normal-form","aliases":["89-df-letterless-normal-form"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"df-letterless-normal-form — Canonical Letterless Normal Form","depends_on":["[[89-df-letterless-trace]]","[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","[[89-df-function]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-letterless-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-letterless-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"df-letterless-normal-form — Canonical Letterless Normal Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f8d035bfd71a4ab\" href=\"?note=4f8d035bfd71a4ab\" title=\"89-df-letterless-trace\">89-df-letterless-trace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" href=\"?note=e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" title=\"89-df-modal-iteration\">89-df-modal-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tc}(A)=(e,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{tc}(A)=(e,E)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inc}(E)\">\\(\\operatorname{inc}(E)\\)</span> 为有限自然数集唯一递增枚举。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i\">\\(R_i\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_0(A)\">\\(N_0(A)\\)</span> 为下文引入的秩标记与正规形函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge,\\bigvee\">\\(\\bigwedge,\\bigvee\\)</span> 允许空序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nR_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box^{i+1}\\bot\\land\\neg\\Box^i\\bot\\quad(i\\in\\omega),\\\\\nN_0(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\bigvee\\langle R_{s_j}\\mid j&lt;|s|\\rangle,&amp;e=0,\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\neg R_{s_j}\\mid j&lt;|s|\\rangle,&amp;e=1.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nR_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box^{i+1}\\bot\\land\\neg\\Box^i\\bot\\quad(i\\in\\omega),\\\\\nN_0(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\bigvee\\langle R_{s_j}\\mid j&lt;|s|\\rangle,&amp;e=0,\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\neg R_{s_j}\\mid j&lt;|s|\\rangle,&amp;e=1.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\coloneqq\\operatorname{inc}(E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\coloneqq\\operatorname{inc}(E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 92–96；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>这里的序列简写按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inc}(E)\">\\(\\operatorname{inc}(E)\\)</span> 的顺序取项。空有限迹得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>，满迹得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_0\">\\(N_0\\)</span> 是由迭代盒矛盾式构成的布尔正规形，区别于原有把任意盒公式视为原子的普通 DNF。对有限的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 排序和折叠构造唯一，因此可以逐步计算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg R_i\">\\(\\neg R_i\\)</span> 在 GL 中等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^{i+1}\\bot\\to\\Box^i\\bot\">\\(\\Box^{i+1}\\bot\\to\\Box^i\\bot\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-letterless-trace","status":"resolved","id":"4f8d035bfd71a4ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-trace]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tc}(A)=(e,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{inc}(E)","display":false},{"tex":"R_i","display":false},{"tex":"N_0(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge,\\bigvee","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nR_i&\\coloneqq\\Box^{i+1}\\bot\\land\\neg\\Box^i\\bot\\quad(i\\in\\omega),\\\\\nN_0(A)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\bigvee\\langle R_{s_j}\\mid j<|s|\\rangle,&e=0,\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\neg R_{s_j}\\mid j<|s|\\rangle,&e=1.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"s\\coloneqq\\operatorname{inc}(E).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{inc}(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"N_0","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg R_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^{i+1}\\bot\\to\\Box^i\\bot","display":false}],"bytes":1557,"backlinks":[{"id":"0b3c8928cef7eaa4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"显式绑定整族有限序列 $\\Gamma$，修复原集合构造中只限制各 $\\Gamma_i$ 却未绑定该族的问题。$m=0$ 给 $\\bot$；某项空合取给 $\\top$。这是把盒子公式当作命题原子的普通析取范式，本库对第 1 章命题语义作的展开，并非原书第 7 章的无字母迭代盒正规形。后者单独由 [[89-df-letterless-normal-form]] 定义。普通 DNF 不应被称为 GL 有限完全性证明的核心步骤。"},{"id":"94d543cad7d7ee3b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c45e0059ab7065e5","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-normal-form]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-formula]] → [[89-df-finite-frame-rank]] → [[89-lem-finite-rank-successors]] → [[89-df-letterless-trace]] → [[89-lem-letterless-trace-code]] → [[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]] → [[89-df-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-thm-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["4f8d035bfd71a4ab","e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","ca21b68a25f1afc2","0d71e87a2f416230"]}